<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A5" title="In Beyond Refusal: Probing the Limits of Agentic Self-Correction for Semantic Sensitive Information" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E </span>Inter Judge agreement</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
</nav>
<div class="ltx_page_main">
