<li id="bib.bib12" class="ltx_bibitem ltx_bib_inproceedings"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_bib_author-year ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Zhang <span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_etal">et al.</span> (2025)</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_author">Q. Zhang, H. Qiu, D. Wang, Y. Li, T. Zhang, W. Zhu, H. Weng, L. Yan, and C. Zhang</span>
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_title">A benchmark for semantic sensitive information in LLMs outputs</span>.
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">In <span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_inbook">The Thirteenth International Conference on Learning Representations</span>,
</span>
