<a href="#S1.p1.1" title="1 Introduction ‣ Beyond Refusal: Probing the Limits of Agentic Self-Correction for Semantic Sensitive Information" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§1</span></a>,
<a href="#S2.p3.1" title="2 Related Work ‣ Beyond Refusal: Probing the Limits of Agentic Self-Correction for Semantic Sensitive Information" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§2</span></a>,
