<a href="#S4.p5.1" title="4 Experimental Setup ‣ Beyond Refusal: Probing the Limits of Agentic Self-Correction for Semantic Sensitive Information" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§4</span></a>,
<a href="#S5.SS5.p2.1" title="5.5 Robustness &amp; Validation ‣ 5 Empirical Results &amp; Analysis ‣ Beyond Refusal: Probing the Limits of Agentic Self-Correction for Semantic Sensitive Information" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§5.5</span></a>.
</span></li>
